Package: PhysioLake
Title: Versioned, Lineage-Tracked Data Management for the Physio Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Integrates the PhysioExperiment ecosystem with 'OmicsLake', a
    versioned, on-disk data-management engine built on 'DuckDB', 'Apache Arrow'
    and 'Parquet' with automatic dataset-level lineage tracking. Rather than
    reimplementing a data lake, PhysioLake inherits the domain-agnostic OmicsLake
    core (storage backend, snapshots and time-travel, cross-dataset lineage,
    query layer) and registers physiology-specific adapters and utilities:
    'PhysioExperiment' objects are stored and retrieved with full fidelity,
    preserving the sampling-rate slot and the W3C-PROV provenance held in object
    metadata. This connects the ecosystem's per-object (micro) provenance with
    the lake's cross-dataset (macro) lineage.
